  "description": "System.Text.Json integration for Bodu.Financial. Provides converters, a shared serialization policy (FinancialJsonPolicy: Strict/Lenient/Compact), the AddFinancialJsonConverters() registration helper for Money, Money<TCurrency>, CalculatedMoney, MoneyBag, ExchangeRate, and CurrencyPair, and the AddFinancialJson() dependency-injection registration. Keeping JSON support in this companion package leaves the core Bodu.Financial library serialization-agnostic.",
